title	hdv_* routines, relocated to $C0100, behind PP's own TRAP #1 entry. LEMLD2 calls its init;
title	the game reaches it through PP's loader (LEMLD2's block). Notes: src/notes/disk-layer.md.
executed	src/d15r/d15r_f5.executed

